==== hyperbricks yaml {!{plugin}} ====
plugin:
  - type: plugin
  - classes:
      - primary
      - secondary
  - plugin: example
==== explainer ====
Optional CSS classes for the plugin output wrapper
==== expected json ====
{
  "Classes": [
    "primary",
    "secondary"
  ],
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "Data": null,
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "PluginName": "example"
}

==== expected output ====
<div class="primary secondary">Plugin example</div>
